+## Failure semantics
+
+The lifecycle hooks also define what a deployer can observe and clean up when a turn fails.
+
+- When `beforeSession` throws an `Error`, the same error is passed with the session to `onError`, `afterSession` then runs with that session, and the original error rejects the caller; because `beforeSession` did not complete, `afterSession` must not assume that turn setup or resource allocation completed ([validated by: reports and cleans up a beforeSession failure before rejecting with the same error](../../src/orchestration/beforeSessionFailure.acceptance.test.ts#L13)).
